  "markdown": "# 💬 Customer feedback #wfy-ns\n\nWhat customers tell us: support tickets, store reviews and interviews, one node per theme. Agents summarize new tickets here.\n\n## \"My list disappears in the store\": 14 tickets this month #offline\n\n> \"No signal in the basement aisle, and my list was blank.\"\n> \"Lost three items I added in the parking garage.\"\n\nPattern: underground stores, rural shops, parking garages. All on version 1.9.\n\n## Request: share one list with my partner #sharing\n\n31 requests since August. Most want both phones to edit the same list, live.\n\n## Praise: recipe import\n\n> \"Saves me twenty minutes every Sunday.\"\n\n## Review digest · Oct 12–18\n\n★ 4.6 from 212 reviews. Top themes: offline (18), sharing (11), scanner speed (6).\n\n## Old idea: download the whole product catalog #offline--deprecated\n\nSuperseded by the sync design: too big for older phones.",
